    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the steel-toe boots of a warehouse operator and experience the grind, pressure, and reward of running your own logistics hub. Pick items, pack orders, manage contracts, hire workers, and grow your empire \u2014 one box at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/13feedddf3de36dce86138b1e44913b2.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=106 /></span>Pick up, tape, scan, and wrap boxes yourself using intuitive controls and realistic animations. Every task is manual \u2014 just like in a real warehouse (Until you expand). <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/5cb40a5c93c65839993d35b02fe6acb2.poster.avif?t=1748331019\" width=298 height=166 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/5cb40a5c93c65839993d35b02fe6acb2.webm?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/5cb40a5c93c65839993d35b02fe6acb2.mp4?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/52f3c32802777307f34c2e9e28427edb.poster.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/52f3c32802777307f34c2e9e28427edb.webm?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/52f3c32802777307f34c2e9e28427edb.mp4?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/2814457f8fe3ab6fdbacf62ec3402dc0.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire warehouse workers, assign them tasks, and upgrade their skills to automate key operations. Balance speed, cost, and efficiency.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/3ae1c85ec19e988a7de9c3e9878288e0.poster.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/3ae1c85ec19e988a7de9c3e9878288e0.webm?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/3ae1c85ec19e988a7de9c3e9878288e0.mp4?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/eaee1f7ab457e0a4cfdede8b475c5566.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure client contracts with time limits and penalties. Choose your orders wisely, meet deadlines, and build your reputation as a reliable fulfilment partner.<br><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/cafc35c378ff6263227383089b080a16.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Secure client contracts with time limits and penalties. Choose your orders wisely, meet deadlines, and build your reputation as a reliable fulfillment partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/d6d8c3c4ed55f8e7880f72d329f38172.poster.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/d6d8c3c4ed55f8e7880f72d329f38172.webm?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/d6d8c3c4ed55f8e7880f72d329f38172.mp4?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/182f191b921786389fd4336dc6da85c2.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start small and scale up. Unlock new zones, build storage racks, add dock bays, and customize your layout as orders increase.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/d64476914f3184fd625da14300b06920.poster.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/d64476914f3184fd625da14300b06920.webm?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/d64476914f3184fd625da14300b06920.mp4?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/f666576037f6a4299f9cb90f24fb40e9.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=106 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Assign unique bin locations, organize your stock, and reduce fulfillment errors with a powerful bin-based inventory system that scales as you grow.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/cf36ba666c43b1d86d2ac7745bd3c098.poster.avif?t=1748331019\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/cf36ba666c43b1d86d2ac7745bd3c098.webm?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3746010/extras/cf36ba666c43b1d86d2ac7745bd3c098.mp4?t=1748331019\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
